        <li>Filing the 1096 annual summary transmittal with the IRS</li>
        <li>Delivering copies to contractors by January 31</li>
        <li>State 1099 filings where required</li>
        <li>NEC vs. MISC classification (which form for which payments)</li>
        <li>Payments through PayPal/Venmo and 1099-K overlap questions</li>
        <li>International contractor reporting (W-8BEN, FATCA)</li>
